  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) with the World Health Oganization (WHO) to provide support to the Medicines Transparency Alliance (MeTA) International Secretariat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) with the World Health Oganization (WHO) to provide support to the Medicines Transparency Alliance (MeTA) International Secretariat is a component of Medicines Transparency Alliance (MeTA) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;3,483,432. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Basic nutrition, Health policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
